      en: ["San Miguel is the third-largest city in El Salvador.", "The Chaparrastique volcano significantly influences soil quality.", "Main center for the processing of henequen (agave fibers).", "Houses the largest commercial center in the east of the country.", "Important transit point for livestock from the region.", "The city was founded on May 8, 1530."],
